<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>洁家家政 - 首页</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: '微软雅黑', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        header {
            background: #ffcc00;
            color: #333;
            padding: 10px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            background: #333;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }
        .nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }
        .main {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .services {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .service-item {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>洁家家政</h1>
    </header>
    <nav class="nav">
        <a href="index.html">首页</a>
        <a href="services.html">服务</a>
        <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
        <a href="booking.html">预约</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="main">
        <h2>专业家政服务，让您的家更温馨</h2>
        <p>洁家家政，为您提供专业的家政服务。我们有一支训练有素的服务团队，致力于为忙碌的您提供便捷、高效、个性化的家政服务。</p>
        <div class="services">
            <div class="service-item">
                <h3>日常保洁</h3>
                <p>定期清洁，包括除尘、拖地、擦窗、洗浴室等。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-item">
                <h3>深度清洁</h3>
                <p>针对厨房、卫生间、空调等难以清洁的地方进行深度清洁。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-item">
                <h3>专业清洗</h3>
                <p>提供沙发清洗、地毯清洗、窗帘清洗等专业清洗服务。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <footer class="footer">
        <p>洁家家政 &copy; 2023</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
